WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:03.737
Lesson three. Ocean Animals!

2
00:00:04.659 --> 00:00:11.809
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.776 --> 00:00:14.425
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.475 --> 00:00:17.997
Today we learn: Ocean Animals! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:23.100
Shark! Say it with me. Shark!

6
00:00:27.137 --> 00:00:30.570
Whale! Say it with me. Whale!

7
00:00:34.589 --> 00:00:38.422
Dolphin! Say it with me. Dolphin!

8
00:00:42.361 --> 00:00:45.895
Crab! Say it with me. Crab!

9
00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:53.866
Octopus! Say it with me. Octopus!

10
00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:01.640
Starfish! Say it with me. Starfish!

11
00:01:05.585 --> 00:01:09.402
Jellyfish! Say it with me. Jellyfish!

12
00:01:13.413 --> 00:01:17.347
Seahorse! Say it with me. Seahorse!

13
00:01:21.406 --> 00:01:26.363
Listen. The dolphin lives in the ocean.

14
00:01:26.413 --> 00:01:29.862
Say it with me. The dolphin lives in the ocean.

15
00:01:34.823 --> 00:01:41.182
Smart dolphins swim and jump gracefully in the blue ocean. The octopus hides among the rocks.

16
00:01:41.232 --> 00:01:42.588
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:48.677
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.727 --> 00:01:49.877
Dolphin!

19
00:01:50.773 --> 00:01:56.081
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:56.131 --> 00:01:57.281
Starfish!

21
00:01:58.278 --> 00:02:03.914
Value corner: Politeness. Saying 'please' and 'thank you' shows we care about others.

22
00:02:03.964 --> 00:02:05.650
I can show politeness too!

23
00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:13.629
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:13.679 --> 00:02:15.200
Bye-bye, friends!

